@inventoryUrl = http://localhost:12004
@accessToken = replace-with-an-access-token
@campaignId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Add stock used by the examples
POST {{inventoryUrl}}/api/inventory/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PHONE-001",
  "quantity": 20000
}

### Create a small-stock campaign (one blocking atomic stock row)
POST {{inventoryUrl}}/api/flash-sales
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PHONE-001",
  "totalQuantity": 50,
  "startsOnUtc": "2026-09-06T00:00:00+08:00",
  "endsOnUtc": "2026-09-06T00:10:00+08:00",
  "purchaseLimit": 1,
  "strategy": "SingleRow"
}

### Create a large-stock campaign (32 independently locked buckets)
POST {{inventoryUrl}}/api/flash-sales
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PHONE-001",
  "totalQuantity": 10000,
  "startsOnUtc": "2026-09-06T01:00:00+08:00",
  "endsOnUtc": "2026-09-06T01:30:00+08:00",
  "purchaseLimit": 2,
  "strategy": "Bucketed",
  "bucketCount": 32
}

### Read durable campaign counters (Redis is only a short-lived read cache)
GET {{inventoryUrl}}/api/flash-sales/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Close the campaign and release inventory not held by pending orders
POST {{inventoryUrl}}/api/flash-sales/{{campaignId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Error path: campaign does not exist
GET {{inventoryUrl}}/api/flash-sales/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
